<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηκ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swimming,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσαῖος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				398b31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.636e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. πλῆθος ἰχθύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					344.15
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.4
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); of a shield, ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.115
			</span></i>; in air as well as water, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πτηνὸν καὶ πεζὸν καὶ νηκτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).207
				</span></i>
			; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ν.</span>”
				<i>power of swimming,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacreont.
					24.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
